I go to the supermarket in my neighbourhood.
There is a lot of light in the shop.
I take a small trolley.
I walk through the long rows of goods.
I push the trolley forward.
I want rice.
I go to the grain section.
I see a bag of rice.
That bag is very heavy.
I pick up the bag.
I put it in the trolley.
Now I want dal.
I like yellow dal.
Here is the yellow dal.
I carefully select a packet.
I put the dal in the trolley too.
My trolley is heavy now.
I want a few more things.
I walk toward the next row.
